<%= @resource_type_label %> Revoked
===============================================

Hello <%= @user.name || @user.email %>,

Your <%= @resource_type_label %> "<%= @resource_name %>" has been revoked or marked as invalid.

This may break CI/CD pipelines and app signing. Please create a replacement resource as soon as possible.

Review Now: <%= case @resource
                when AppleCertificate
                  organization_apple_certificates_url(@resource.organization)
